a":"மண்","gloss":"earth"}],"gloss":"earth"},{"surface":"எடுத்து","parts":[{"text":"எடுத்து","lemma":"எடு","gloss":"digging up"}],"gloss":"digging up"},{"surface":"உண்ணும்","parts":[{"text":"உண்ணும்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"eating"}],"gloss":"eating"},{"surface":"அண்ணல்","parts":[{"text":"அண்ணல்","lemma":"அண்ணல்","gloss":"majestic"}],"gloss":"majestic"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வண்","parts":[{"text":"வண்","lemma":"வண்மை","gloss":"generous"}],"gloss":"generous"},{"surface":"தேர்","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"chariot"},{"surface":"தொண்டையர்","parts":[{"text":"தொண்டையர்","lemma":"தொண்டையர்","gloss":"Tondaiyar rulers"}],"gloss":"of the Tondaiyar rulers"},{"surface":"வழை","parts":[{"text":"வழை","lemma":"வழை","gloss":"surapunnai tree"}],"gloss":"surapunnai trees"},{"surface":"அமல்","parts":[{"text":"அமல்","lemma":"அமல்","gloss":"dense"}],"gloss":"dense"},{"surface":"அடுக்கத்து","parts":[{"text":"அடுக்கத்து","lemma":"அடுக்கத்து","gloss":"on the mountain slope"}],"gloss":"on the mountain slope","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"கன்று","lemma":"கன்று","gloss":"calf"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without its calf"},{"surface":"ஓரா","parts":[{"text":"ஓரா","lemma":"ஓரா","gloss":"cow"}],"gloss":"cow"},{"surface":"விலங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"விலங்கிய","lemma":"விலங்கு","gloss":"standing across"}],"gloss":"standing across"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புன்","parts":[{"text":"புன்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"dry"}],"gloss":"dry"},{"surface":"தாள்","parts":[{"text":"தாள்","lemma":"தாள்","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"trunk"},{"surface":"ஓமைய","parts":[{"text":"ஓமை","lemma":"ஓமை","gloss":"omai tree"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the omai trees"},{"surface":"சுரன்","parts":[{"text":"சுரன்","lemma":"சுரம்","gloss":"desert path"}],"gloss":"desert path"},{"surface":"இறந்தோரே","parts":[{"text":"இறந்தோர்","lemma":"இற","gloss":"he who traversed"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he who traversed indeed"}]}],"literal":"The wild jasmine and the bushes climbing the vast sky / have opened their mouths as striped bees hummed. / Will your shoulders, beautified by curved bangles, shrink, / or will he return, may you live, friend, he who seeks wealth? / Majestic elephants dig up and eat the earth / on the mountain slopes dense with surapunnai trees of the Tondaiyar of generous chariots, / where a cow, not seeing its calf, stands across / the desert path of dry-trunked omai trees, which he traversed.","translation":"May you live, my friend! The wild jasmine and the bushes climbing toward the vast sky have blossomed, opening their buds as striped bees hummed. Will he return, he who went to seek wealth, before your shoulders, adorned with curved bangles, waste away? He has traversed the desert path of dry-trunked omai trees, where a mother cow, unable to find her calf, stands lost and blocking the way, in the mountain slopes dense with surapunnai trees belonging to the Tondaiyar of generous chariots, where majestic elephants dig up and eat the earth.","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! பெரிய வானத்தை நோக்கிப் படரும் காட்டு மல்லிகையும் புதர்களும், வரிகளையுடைய வண்டுகள் ஊதும்படித் தம் மலர் வாய்களை அவிழ்த்துவிட்டன. வளமான தேர்களைக் கொண்ட தொண்டையர்களது, சுரபுன்னை மரங்கள் செறிந்த மலைச்சாரலில், களிமண்ணைத் தோண்டி உண்ணும் பெருமையுடைய யானைகள் வாழும் வழியில், தன் கன்றைக் காணாத பசுவானது குறுக்கே நின்று தவிக்கும், உலர்ந்த அடிகளையுடைய ஓமை மரங்கள் நிறைந்த பாலைவன வழியைக் கடந்து சென்ற நம் தலைவர், வளைந்த வளையல்கள் அணிந்து விளங்கும் உன் தோள்கள் மெலிந்து வாடுவதற்குள் பொருள் தேடித் திரும்புவாரோ?","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) is speaking to the heroine (talaivi) to comfort her as the rainy season begins. The hero had departed to earn wealth, and the heroine is anxious that her beauty will fade and her bangles will slip off her wasting shoulders before his return. The friend points out that the wild jasmine has already blossomed with the humming of bees, indicating the arrival of the season. She describes the harsh desert path the hero traversed, which lies beyond the mountain slopes of the Tondaiyar kings. In this desert, a mother cow stands lost and blocking the path because she cannot find her calf, an image that mirrors the heroine's own agonizing separation. The majestic elephants digging up the earth for food represent the arduous effort of seeking wealth, reassuring the heroine of the hero's purposeful journey and imminent return.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.35],[1.35,1.78],[1.78,2.1],[2.1,3.2],[3.2,3.46],[3.46,3.71],[3.71,4.1],[4.1,4.77],[4.77,5.3],[5.3,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,7.03],[7.03,7.3],[7.3,7.9],[7.9,8.4],[8.4,8.96],[9.14,9.7],[9.7,10.2],[10.2,10.57],[10.57,11.5],[11.5,11.8],[11.8,12.2],[12.2,12.7],[12.7,13.0],[13.0,13.2],[13.2,13.5],[13.5,13.96],[13.96,14.42],[14.42,15.18],[15.18,15.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.27],[1.27,1.72],[1.72,2.1],[2.1,2.93],[2.93,3.3],[3.3,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,5.29],[5.29,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,6.7],[6.7,7.53],[7.53,7.8],[7.8,8.4],[8.53,9.2],[9.2,9.43],[9.43,10.8],[10.8,11.3],[11.3,11.54],[11.54,12.14],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.5],[13.5,14.2],[14.2,14.5],[14.5,14.7],[14.7,15.0],[15.23,16.14],[16.14,16.73],[16.73,17.65],[17.65,17.9]]},"sync":[[["குருகும்","wild jasmine and"]],[["இரு","vast"],["விசும்பு","sky"]],[["விசும்பு","sky"],["இவரும்","climbing"]],[["புதலும்","and the bushes"]],[["வரி","striped"],["வண்டு","bee"]],[["வண்டு","bee"],["ஊத","to hum"]],[["வாய்","mouth"],["நெகிழ்ந்தனவே","indeed opened"]],[["நெகிழ்ந்தனவே","indeed opened"]],[["சுரி","curved"],["வளை","bangle"]],[["பொலிந்த","shining"]],[["தோளும்","shoulders too"]],[["செற்றும்","shrinking"]],[["வருவர்","he will return"],["கொல்","will he?"]],[["வாழி","may you live"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["பொருவார்","he who seeks wealth"]],[["மண்","earth"],["எடுத்து","digging up"]],[["எடுத்து","digging up"],["உண்ணும்","eating"]],[["அண்ணல்","majestic"]],[["யானை","elephant"]],[["வண்","generous"],["தேர்","chariot"]],[["தொண்டையர்","of the Tondaiyar rulers"]],[["வழை","surapunnai trees"],["அமல்","dense"]],[["அமல்","dense"],["அடுக்கத்து","on the mountain slope"]],[["கன்றில்","without its calf"]],[["கன்றில்","without its calf"],["ஓரா","cow"]],[["விலங்கிய","standing across"]],[["புன்","dry"],["தாள்","trunk"]],[["தாள்","trunk"],["ஓமைய","of the omai trees"]],[["சுரன்","desert path"],["இறந்தோரே","he who traversed indeed"]],[["இறந்தோரே","he who traversed indeed"]]]}